            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of sudden unexpected death in an apparently fit and healthy young man is reported. Autopsy showed severe atherosclerotic heart disease. There was a family history of a disorder of lipid metabolism.</AbstractText>
